# Witness for RoutingMeetsCoreStraddler. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a straddler - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: RoutingMeetsCoreStraddlerWitness
TARGET: RoutingMeetsCoreStraddler
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a straddler is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("RoutingMeetsCoreStraddler", CStraddlerAlloc)
--- REPLACE
Fails("RoutingMeetsCoreStraddler", FALSE)
--- END
